### Cancel all payments for an order (only if state is ArrangingPayment or PaymentAuthorized)

### Cancel all payments for my order (Shop API)
POST http://192.168.0.53:3000/shop-api
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{shop_token}}

{
  "query": "mutation CancelAllPaymentsOnOrder($orderCode: String!) { cancelAllPaymentsOnOrder(orderCode: $orderCode) { id code active state payments { id state method amount errorMessage } } }",
  "variables": {
    "orderCode": "XKC5YZU7PHY8JH4S"
  }
}

